# No Manual — a Hermes Agent plugin

**Furniture with no instructions? Send Hermes a few photos.**
No Manual finds the official manual, turns your disassembly photos into a
manual in reverse, or works out flat-pack assembly from the parts — then
coaches you step by step and checks a photo of each step.

<banner / GIF of the 3D viewer>

## What it does
- 🔎 **Finds the real manual** from labels, stamped numbers and shape.
- 📸 **Records your disassembly** (moving?) and reverses it into instructions.
- 🧩 **Solves flat-pack furniture** (closets, wardrobes, bookcases, cabinets,
  nightstands) from photos of the parts and your tape-measure dimensions.
- ✅ **Checks every step** from your photo and stops you before mistakes.
- 🖥️ **3D step viewer** in Hermes Desktop; step images in Telegram/WhatsApp.

## Safety
Generated instructions are a best effort. Follow the official manual whenever
one exists. No Manual **never** generates instructions for children's
furniture (cribs, bunk/loft beds, high chairs, changing tables) or anything
people sit, sleep or climb on — for those it only finds the official manual.
Tall furniture always ends with a wall-anchoring step.

## Install
`hermes plugins install no-manual` (from the Hermes Marketplace once listed)
Requires a vision-capable model in Hermes.

## Use
"I lost the manual for my bookcase" + photos. Or `/nomanual` to list projects.

