## How it works
Vision (through your own provider via Hermes) reads photos into structured
data; everything else — classification, assembly order, hardware counts,
drawings — is deterministic code. Pictures are drawn from geometry, never
generated.

## Roadmap
AR overlay on the phone camera · drawers and hinged doors in the solver ·
replacement-part finder.

